Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): scope negated obligations and explain evidence
 resubmission [daveey]

Root: positive route grammar matched negative/removal obligations; errors omitted the supported lossless evidence label. Normalize only the local negative span so trailing active mandates remain rejected. Keep ambiguous historical lines refused with exact quoting guidance. Correct adopted-probe docstring.

Proof: unchanged independent probe 6 passed/8 failed; focused four files 90 passed; final new file 34 passed. Stable 128 importing/retained facade consumers 2929 passed/0 failed/1 skipped, retries OFF; new34 file separately green. Full static gate only has untouched sidebar ratchet failures against advanced main; canonical ship clean rebase must re-run all gates. Original fleet inventory/remediation/deployment remains open.
